FoamFile
{
    version     2.0;
    format      ascii;
    class       volScalarField;
    object      note;
}

Removed the 'relaxationFactors' block from system/fvSolution. The PISO algorithm used by icoFoam does not support under-relaxation factors for fields or equations. Including this block causes a dictionary parsing error ('in file db/dictionary/dictionary.C') because the solver expects specific keys and fails on unexpected ones, leading to immediate exit before time stepping.
